"Follow the targets through the two rising corners." = "沿目标经过两个向上的拐角。";
"Alternate a right turn and a left turn to face up again." = "交替使用右转和左转，可以重新朝上。";
"Keep the lights" = "守住亮光";
"Avoid a trap so the targets you already lit stay lit." = "避开陷阱，让已经点亮的目标保持亮起。";
"The marked trap lies between the two targets." = "带 × 的陷阱位于两个目标之间。";
"After the lower target, detour two cells to the right." = "到达下方目标后，向右绕开两格。";
"Light it again" = "重新点亮";
"Recover from a trap by revisiting any target it erased." = "踩到陷阱后，重新经过被熄灭的目标也能完成。";
"A trap clears all lit targets, not just the nearest one." = "陷阱会清空全部已点亮目标，不只影响附近的目标。";
"A loop can visit the lower target again after the upper one." = "可以走一圈，在上方目标之后重新经过下方目标。";
"Perimeter patrol" = "沿边巡游";
"Combine counting and turns to patrol a square boundary." = "结合步数与转向，沿正方形边缘巡游。";
"Each side has the same length." = "每一条边的长度相同。";
"Write one side and a right turn, then repeat that pattern." = "先写一条边和一次右转，再重复这个模式。";
"A name for three steps" = "为三步取名";
"Name a repeated idea" = "给重复命名";
"Name three steps as a procedure and call it repeatedly." = "把三步定义成一个过程，再反复调用。";
"The byte limit is shorter than the full straight route." = "byte 限制比直接写完这条直线所需的代码更短。";
"Declare a:sss on one line; call a on the final line." = "在一行声明 a:sss，在最后一行调用 a。";
"Square stamp" = "方形印章";
"Reuse a side-and-turn procedure four times." = "把走一边再转向的过程重复四次。";
"The four sides share one movement pattern." = "四条边共用同一段动作。";
"Put the right turn inside the procedure, after the steps." = "把右转放进过程里，接在前进指令后面。";
"Stair tiles" = "阶梯砖块";
"Find a repeated stair tile that ends facing up." = "找出一个重复阶梯单元，让它结束时仍朝上。";
"Each tile rises two cells and moves right two cells." = "每个单元向上两格，再向右两格。";
"Use a right turn to go across and a left turn to face up." = "右转后横走，再左转恢复朝上。";
"Four compass arms" = "四向罗盘";
"Make an out-and-back procedure rotate toward the next arm." = "让往返过程结束时转向下一条分支。";
"Every arm starts from the center." = "每条分支都从中心出发。";
"Go out, turn back, return, then turn toward the next arm." = "走出去、掉头、回中心，再转向下一条分支。";
"Rhythm within rhythm" = "节奏中的节奏";
"Group repeated procedure calls into a second procedure." = "把重复的过程调用再组合成第二个过程。";
"There are nine identical stair tiles." = "这里有九个相同的阶梯单元。";
"Three groups of three calls use fewer bytes than nine calls." = "把三次调用组成一组，再调用三组，比写九次调用更短。";
"A self-repeating stair" = "自动延伸的阶梯";
"Control recursion" = "控制递归";
"Use a procedure that calls itself after one stair tile." = "每完成一个阶梯单元，就让过程再次调用自己。";
"The route repeats without changing its shape." = "路线一直重复同一种形状。";
"Put a call to a at the end of a; completion stops execution." = "在 a 的末尾调用 a；全部目标亮起时游戏会停止执行。";
"A counted corner" = "数得清的拐角";
"Use a numeric parameter to walk two different distances." = "用数值参数控制两段不同长度的前进。";
"One segment is seven cells; the other is four." = "一段长七格，另一段长四格。";
"A recursive step counter can subtract 1 until the call is skipped." = "递归计步过程每次减 1，直到参数非正而跳过调用。";
"Rectangle recipe" = "长方形配方";
"Compose a rectangle from one reusable counted walk." = "用一个可复用的计步过程拼出长方形。";
"The long side is eight cells and the short side is four." = "长边八格，短边四格。";
"Group a long side and a short side, then use that group twice." = "把一条长边和一条短边组成一组，再用两次。";
"Growing spiral" = "生长的螺旋";
"Increase a numeric distance after each right turn." = "每次右转后，把下一段的长度增加一格。";
"The segment lengths are 1, 2, 3, and so on." = "各段长度依次为 1、2、3……";
"Separate the counted walk from the recursive spiral." = "把计步过程与螺旋递归过程分开。";
"Descending staircase" = "逐级缩短";
"Walk equal vertical and horizontal legs, then reduce both." = "每级先走等长的纵横两段，再缩短下一级。";
"The stair lengths shrink from six to one." = "阶梯长度从六格逐渐缩短到一格。";
"Pass X to both legs and X-1 to the next stair call." = "两段都使用 X，把 X-1 传给下一次阶梯调用。";
"Pass a pattern" = "把图案传进去";
"Pass instructions" = "传递指令";
"Pass a side-and-turn instruction sequence as a parameter." = "把走一边再转向的指令串作为参数传入。";
"A parameter can represent instructions instead of a number." = "参数除了数值，也可以代表一串指令。";
"A body containing XXXX executes the supplied sequence four times." = "过程体中的 XXXX 会把传入的指令串执行四次。";
"A reusable repeater" = "通用重复器";
"Combine a repetition count with an instruction parameter." = "把重复次数与指令参数组合起来。";
"Use one parameter for six repeats and another for a stair tile." = "一个参数表示重复六次，另一个表示阶梯单元。";
"Execute Y, then call the repeater with X-1 and the same Y." = "执行 Y，再用 X-1 和同一个 Y 调用重复器。";
"Alternating rows" = "来回的灯带";
"Alternate two instruction patterns to sweep parallel rows." = "交替执行两种指令模式，扫过平行的灯带。";
"One row turns right twice; the next turns left twice." = "一行结束时连续两次右转，下一行则两次左转。";
"Swap instruction parameters when recursively calling the next row." = "递归到下一行时，交换两个指令参数。";
"A growing thread" = "不断加长的线";
"Grow an instruction parameter by appending two steps." = "每次在指令参数后追加两步，让路径逐渐增长。";
"This spiral turns left and has lengths 2, 4, 6, and so on." = "这条螺旋每次左转，各段长 2、4、6……";
"Execute X, turn left, then pass Xss into the next call." = "执行 X、左转，再把 Xss 传给下一次调用。";
"Expanding compass" = "伸展的罗盘";
"Reuse a growing instruction sequence for both outward and return travel." = "用同一个逐渐增长的指令串完成出发与返回。";
"Return to the center before exploring the next direction." = "探索下一个方向前，先回到中心。";
"Execute X twice with a half turn between them, then grow X." = "两次执行 X，中间掉头，然后给 X 增加一步。";
"Twin towers" = "双塔灯光";
"Compose a small program" = "组合成小程序";
"Combine a counted walk, a return trip and a connecting bridge." = "组合计步、原路返回和连接两侧的桥。";
"The trap row makes crossing between the towers unsafe." = "两塔中间的一排陷阱让横穿变得危险。";
"Finish one tower, return to the bottom, then cross to the other." = "先走完一座塔，返回底部，再横走到另一座。";
"Woven field" = "编织灯田";
"Use a finite row count and alternate the connector’s turn direction." = "用有限的行数控制灯田，并交替改变连接处的转向。";
"Each row is eight cells long; safe connectors are at the ends." = "每行长八格，安全的连接处在两端。";
"Adding rr to a turn parameter switches its effective direction." = "给转向参数增加 rr，可以切换它实际的转向方向。";
"Rising comb" = "向上生长的梳齿";
"Grow each branch, return to the baseline, then shift one cell." = "让每根分支增长，返回基线后横移一格。";
"The teeth have lengths 1 through 9 and share a baseline." = "梳齿长度从 1 到 9，共用一条基线。";
"Reuse the same counted walk outward and back; restore the heading." = "出发与返回复用同一个计步过程，并恢复原朝向。";
"Nested windows" = "层叠的窗";
"Nest a counted walk inside a fourfold instruction repeater." = "把计步前进嵌套进重复四次的指令参数中。";
"Four squares share a corner; their side lengths are 3, 6, 9 and 12." = "四个正方形共用一个角，边长分别为 3、6、9、12。";
"A square can repeat the instruction “walk X, turn right” four times." = "一个正方形就是把「走 X 步，再右转」重复四次。";
"Clockwork garden" = "发条花园";
"Combine counted repetition, shrinking squares and fourfold rotation." = "组合计数重复、逐渐缩小的正方形与四向旋转。";
"Each quadrant contains squares with sides 6, 4 and 2." = "每个象限中都有边长为 6、4、2 的正方形。";
"Build one square, recurse with X-2, then rotate the whole motif." = "先构造一个正方形，再用 X-2 递归，最后旋转整个图案。";
